          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Purchase one <a href=\"https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade\" title=\"https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade\">MoonShade</a>  and a  <a href=\"https://moonfab.com/products/moonwall-short\" title=\"https://moonfab.com/products/moonwall-short\">MoonWall Short</a> or <a href=\"https://moonfab.com/products/moonwall-long\" title=\"https://moonfab.com/products/moonwall-long\">MoonWall Long</a>  and receive $10 off each MoonWall. Can be combined with certain other discounts, including MoonShade referral discount and free shipping promotions. Deal can be redeemed once per transaction, for $10 off each MoonWall bundled with the MoonShade. Deal will be auto-applied at checkout, no code needed. Exclusions may apply. Moon reserves the right to limit or discontinue the bundle deal at any time.</p>"
          }
